RecordsTabsBody:"This tab container switches between Products and Categories. Categories control grouping/selection, while Products are the items you will later generate EPC batches for.",tourAdminRecordsCategoryTitle:"Add Category",tourAdminRecordsCategoryBody:"Use this button to add a new Category (name + short code). Keep it Active so it can be selected when creating Products.",tourAdminRecordsProductTitle:"Create Product",tourAdminRecordsProductBody:"Use this button to create a Product (SKU, name, product code, and category). Keep it Active so it shows up during EPC batch generation.",tourAdminEpcHeaderBody:"EPC module is for batch generation and bulk operations. Typical flow: Generate a batch → export XLSX → (optional) Scan Input to fill Net Weight/CAIQ → proceed to encoding/production.",tourAdminEpcGenerateTitle:"Generate EPC batch",tourAdminEpcGenerateBody:"Click Generate to create a batch and export EPC items as XLSX. Make sure the correct Auth Certificate template is selected for the batch before exporting.",tourAdminCertHeaderBody:"Certificate list is where you manage certificate templates. Templates define the background and which dynamic fields will be printed on the certificate.",tourAdminCertCreateTitle:"Add certificate template",tourAdminCertCreateBody:"Create a new certificate template, then open the designer to upload a background and place fields (certificate ID, product, batch, etc.). You can reuse templates across products/batches.",tourAdminCmsHeaderBody:"Landing Page Design (CMS) is where you build the public page shown to end users after verification. You can create pages, switch language, save changes, and publish updates.",tourAdminCmsCanvasTitle:"Canvas panel",tourAdminCmsCanvasBody:"This canvas container is where you arrange blocks (text, image, video, certificate) and control layout. Select a block on the canvas to edit it.",tourAdminCmsInspectorTitle:"Inspector panel",tourAdminCmsInspectorBody:"This inspector container shows settings for the selected block (content, style, spacing). Use it to configure containers and fine-tune how the landing page looks.",tourAdminCmsPublishTitle:"Publish updates",tourAdminCmsPublishBody:"Use Publish to push the latest landing page content to end users. After publishing, verify the flow using a real certificate ID on the public verify page.",productModule:"Product Module",cmsLanding:"Landing Page Design",cmsCertificate:"CMS Certificate Page",settings:"Settings",profile:"Profile settings",profileHint:"Update your profile details and password.",systemSettings:"System settings",systemSettingsHint:"Configure global system preferences.",epcGeneratedEmailNotify:"EPC generated email notification",epcGeneratedEmailNotifyHint:"Send email to selected roles every time an EPC batch is generated.",epcProductionOrdersEmailNotify:"Production orders email notification",epcProductionOrdersEmailNotifyHint:"Send email to selected roles when Production Orders XLSX is uploaded.",notificationRoles:"Notification roles",notificationRolesHint:"Select roles that will receive notification emails.",selectRoles:"Select roles…",notificationRolesRequired:"At least one role is required.",invalidRoleList:"Invalid role list. Use lowercase role names and separate by comma.",imageMode:"Image mode",actualOrFit:"Actual / fit",stretch:"Stretch",cropImage:"Crop image",cropHint:"Drag to move. Drag corners to resize. Click outside to draw a new crop.",cropTip:"Tip: If you want the whole image, click “Use original”.",useOriginal:"Use original",cropAndUpload:"Crop & upload",cropFailed:"Crop failed",processing:"Processing…",backgroundColor:"Page background color",guideFlow:"End-to-end flow",guideOps:"Daily operations",guideTroubleshooting:"Troubleshooting",openModule:"Open module",guideStepProductsTitle:"Create products",guideStepProductsBody:"Create product name and unique code. Optionally set origin/description and link CMS page + certificate template.",guideStepBatchesTitle:"Create batch + generate EPC",guideStepBatchesBody:"Create a batch, choose a certificate template, then Generate to export an EPC XLSX.",guideStepGenerateTitle:"Generate certificates",guideStepGenerateBody:"Generate batch certificate (1 per batch) or unit certificates (1 per box) based on your NFC cost strategy.",guideStepAssignTitle:"Assign NFC UID / EPC",guideStepAssignBody:"Bind a physical tag to a certificate ID. This is required for tap/scan to resolve correctly.",guideStepCmsTitle:"Build landing page (CMS)",guideStepCmsBody:"Design your public landing page using blocks (text, image, video, certificate). Save and preview with a real certificate ID.",guideStepTemplateTitle:"Build certificate template",guideStepTemplateBody:"Upload a background and place dynamic fields (certificate ID, product, batch). Save and reuse across products.",guideStepPublishTitle:"Publish CMS page",guideStepPublishBody:"Publish the CMS page so end users see the latest content after scanning.",guideStepVerifyTitle:"Verify end user flow",guideStepVerifyBody:"Scan NFC or open /verify/<CERTIFICATE_ID>. Confirm status, CMS layout, and certificate info are correct.",guideOpsMonitoringTitle:"Monitor scan activity",guideOpsMonitoringBody:"Use Analytics to review recent scans, risk flags, and certificate timeline.",guideOpsFraudTitle:"Handle fraud cases",guideOpsFraudBody:"Review open fraud flags, resolve them, and cross-check certificate history.",guideOpsBulkTitle:"Bulk import/export (Excel)",guideOpsBulkBody:"Use EPC module for bulk import (XLSX) and export EPC batch list as XLSX.",guideOpsGovernanceTitle:"Audit & access control",guideOpsGovernanceBody:"Use Audit Log for traceability. Super Admin manages users and roles.",guideOpsIntegrationsTitle:"API keys & webhooks",guideOpsIntegrationsBody:"Create API keys for integrations and configure webhooks for events.",guideTroubleshootingTitle:"Quick troubleshooting",guideTs401:"If admin shows 401 after login, ensure API calls avoid /products redirect and token is attached.",guid